WEBVTT

32:10.205 --> 32:13.875
- Have you ever seen a dragon?
- Dragon gone, Khaleesi.

32:14.584 --> 32:16.836
Everywhere? Even in the East?

32:16.961 --> 32:19.964
No dragon. Brave men kill them.

32:20.590 --> 32:23.009
- It is known.
- It is known.

32:23.134 --> 32:27.013
A trader from Qarth told me
that dragons come from the moon.

32:27.138 --> 32:29.265
The moon?

32:29.390 --> 32:32.018
He told me the moon
was an egg, Khaleesi,
